   Sustainable Rating System},
Keywords-Plus = {LIFE-CYCLE ASSESSMENT; RECLAIMED ASPHALT; RECYCLED MATERIALS; ASSESSMENT
   LCA; ROAD; CONCRETE; INFRASTRUCTURE; CONSTRUCTION; TECHNOLOGIES;
